  "rationale": "The chart contains an explicit assessment statement: 'The assessment records that heart failure with reduced ejection fraction and it is active.' The ejection fraction is documented as 32%, confirming systolic dysfunction. BNP is elevated at 880, supporting the diagnosis. No negation, family history, screening, hypothetical, or resolved language appears in the mention windows. The combination of active clinical assessment, reduced EF, and supportive lab meets criteria for chronic systolic heart failure (I50.22).",
